    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried talking to someone once but it felt so performative. like they’re just reading from a script and i'm just checking boxes. idk. it doesn't change the fact that i'm just... hollow. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does. everything is just monochrome. it’s like i’m already gone, i’m just still walking around.",
