      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if that makes sense. i mean, i feel like i'm just stuck in this loop. i wake up, i do the stuff i'm supposed to do, i pretend to be fine, and then i sleep just so i can do it again. it's like there's no exit. i just want the noise and the emptiness to stop. i just want some kind of peace, but i don't even know if that's possible anymore.",
